{"id":"c35","stage":5,"title":"AI 与研究责任","scene":"讨论辅助工具和作者责任。","roles":["研究伙伴","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c35-1","ko":"인공지능을 활용하면 연구 속도를 높일 수 있겠죠?","zh":"使用人工智能，可以提高研究速度吧？","note":"활용하다：运用。","words":[{"term":"인공지능","zh":"人工智能","id":"c597b282778e3c88","audio":"/audio/c597b282778e3c885464.mp3"},{"term":"활용하다","zh":"运用","id":"f80a1d3b7dd20c8f","audio":"/audio/f80a1d3b7dd20c8fedd2.mp3"},{"term":"속도","zh":"速度","id":"c03f7e871a4127c4","audio":"/audio/c03f7e871a4127c448d9.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/77daf3cf86632b7488c2.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"인공지능을","meaning":"人工智能","explanation":"인공지능（人工智能）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"인공지능","audio":"/audio/c597b282778e3c885464.mp3"}]},{"text":"활용하면","meaning":"运用的话","explanation":"활용하다（运用）+ -면（条件）。","readings":[{"term":"활용하다","audio":"/audio/f80a1d3b7dd20c8fedd2.mp3"}]},{"text":"연구","meaning":"研究","explanation":"연구修饰속도。","readings":[{"term":"속도","audio":"/audio/c03f7e871a4127c448d9.mp3"}]},{"text":"속도를","meaning":"速度","explanation":"속도（速度）+ 를（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"속도","audio":"/audio/c03f7e871a4127c448d9.mp3"}]},{"text":"높일","meaning":"提高","explanation":"높이다（提高）+ -ㄹ，修饰수。","readings":[{"term":"높일","audio":"/audio/fe8b08afaafec1d8e499.mp3"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可能","explanation":"수与있다表示能够。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}]},{"text":"있겠죠?","meaning":"应该能吧？","explanation":"있다 + -겠-（推测）+ -지요 → -겠죠（征求认同）。","readings":[{"term":"있겠죠","audio":"/audio/b893bbd1e5f078733c04.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c35-2","ko":"그렇지만 생성된 내용을 검증할 책임은 연구자에게 있어요.","zh":"不过，核验生成内容的责任在研究者。","note":"“责任在某人”用 책임이 …에게 있다。","words":[{"term":"생성되다","zh":"被生成","id":"0dbcd3ab07165f66","audio":"/audio/0dbcd3ab07165f66e39b.mp3"},{"term":"검증하다","zh":"核验","id":"82db74cccd0a760a","audio":"/audio/82db74cccd0a760aaef5.mp3"},{"term":"연구자","zh":"研究者","id":"9bc07d0c7c37690e","audio":"/audio/9bc07d0c7c37690e4690.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/4104158dd64138c812fd.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"그렇지만","meaning":"不过","explanation":"그렇지만是表示转折的连接副词。","readings":[{"term":"그렇지만","audio":"/audio/47d15ebbdcc7c92499f0.mp3"}]},{"text":"생성된","meaning":"生成的","explanation":"생성되다（被生成）+ -ㄴ（过去定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"생성되다","audio":"/audio/0dbcd3ab07165f66e39b.mp3"}]},{"text":"내용을","meaning":"内容","explanation":"내용（内容）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"내용을","audio":"/audio/666977270e450d47deca.mp3"}]},{"text":"검증할","meaning":"核验的","explanation":"검증하다（核验）+ -ㄹ（定语形），修饰책임。","readings":[{"term":"검증하다","audio":"/audio/82db74cccd0a760aaef5.mp3"}]},{"text":"책임은","meaning":"责任","explanation":"책임（责任）+ 은（话题）。","readings":[{"term":"책임은","audio":"/audio/deaace9f1e5012f3227d.mp3"}]},{"text":"연구자에게","meaning":"在研究者","explanation":"연구자（研究者）+ 에게（责任归属方）。","readings":[{"term":"연구자","audio":"/audio/9bc07d0c7c37690e4690.mp3"}]},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"在","explanation":"있다（有、在）的礼貌形式；책임이 …에게 있다表示责任在某人。","readings":[{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c35-3","ko":"존재하지 않는 문헌을 제시하는 경우도 있다고 들었어요.","zh":"我听说也会出现提供不存在的文献的情况。","note":"以转述方式提出风险。","words":[{"term":"존재하다","zh":"存在","id":"85dd9a249ce7d326","audio":"/audio/85dd9a249ce7d3261b96.mp3"},{"term":"문헌","zh":"文献","id":"38dfe6c0e247f296","audio":"/audio/38dfe6c0e247f2964a23.mp3"},{"term":"경우","zh":"情况","id":"0925aa90ecffa7d6","audio":"/audio/0925aa90ecffa7d68ff7.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/fce54ec1a4c26d419b42.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"존재하지","meaning":"存在","explanation":"존재하다（存在）+ -지，连接않다。","readings":[{"term":"존재하다","audio":"/audio/85dd9a249ce7d3261b96.mp3"}]},{"text":"않는","meaning":"不……的","explanation":"않다（不）+ -는（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"않는","audio":"/audio/0770cbaff225bd5dc7f7.mp3"}]},{"text":"문헌을","meaning":"文献","explanation":"문헌（文献）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"문헌","audio":"/audio/38dfe6c0e247f2964a23.mp3"}]},{"text":"제시하는","meaning":"提供的","explanation":"제시하다（提供、提出）+ -는（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"제시하는","audio":"/audio/9b5ff675c9cebdc109b0.mp3"}]},{"text":"경우도","meaning":"情况也","explanation":"경우（情况）+ 도（也）。","readings":[{"term":"경우","audio":"/audio/0925aa90ecffa7d68ff7.mp3"}]},{"text":"있다고","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다（有）的间接引用形式，接引用语尾-다고。","readings":[{"term":"있다고","audio":"/audio/4df9048dde2a8a3e535d.mp3"}]},{"text":"들었어요.","meaning":"听说了","explanation":"듣다（听）→ 들었어요，ㄷ不规则的过去礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"들었어요","audio":"/audio/8c00cca6003a8c8b75f7.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c35-4","ko":"그래서 원문을 직접 확인하고 인용의 맥락을 살펴봐야 해요.","zh":"所以要亲自核对原文，并考察引用的语境。","note":"살펴보다：仔细查看。","words":[{"term":"원문","zh":"原文","id":"0201f36241b8014e","audio":"/audio/0201f36241b8014e9f29.mp3"},{"term":"직접","zh":"亲自","id":"20c483bdda9706e4","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"},{"term":"인용","zh":"引用","id":"4a02004ab78c6f58","audio":"/audio/4a02004ab78c6f5871be.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/7ab814346354caad6a5a.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"그래서","meaning":"所以","explanation":"그래서连接前面的原因和后面的行动。","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}]},{"text":"원문을","meaning":"原文","explanation":"원문（原文）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"원문","audio":"/audio/0201f36241b8014e9f29.mp3"}]},{"text":"직접","meaning":"亲自","explanation":"직접表示直接做。","readings":[{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}]},{"text":"확인하고","meaning":"核对并","explanation":"확인하다（确认）+ -고（连接）。","readings":[{"term":"확인하고","audio":"/audio/983597e9597e3dc526d2.mp3"}]},{"text":"인용의","meaning":"引用的","explanation":"인용（引用）+ 의（修饰关系）。","readings":[{"term":"인용","audio":"/audio/4a02004ab78c6f5871be.mp3"}]},{"text":"맥락을","meaning":"语境","explanation":"맥락（语境）+ 을（宾格）。","readings":[{"term":"맥락을","audio":"/audio/bc46e0ed1cfb6086d315.mp3"}]},{"text":"살펴봐야","meaning":"应仔细查看","explanation":"살펴보다（仔细察看）→ 살펴봐야；-아/어야表示必须。","readings":[{"term":"살펴봐야","audio":"/audio/5b34bc59aeb927cf44d4.mp3"}]},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"应该","explanation":"하다的礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c35-5","ko":"개인 정보나 공개되지 않은 자료를 입력할 때도 주의해야겠네요.","zh":"输入个人信息或未公开资料时，也应注意。","note":"공개되지 않은 修饰资料。","words":[{"term":"공개되다","zh":"被公开","id":"9ebfdaabd37011ee","audio":"/a